/Title (The house belongs to the Al-Almani family, a well-known Baghdadi family with a longstanding interest in antiques and works of art. Over the years, the house became home to a diverse collection of objects including copper, silver and wooden pieces, crystal, paintings, artworks, decorative objects and antiques from different periods and origins.)
